        {"message_id":"MSG-C03-001","timestamp":"2026-10-29T18:12:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"今天买的那个包，肩带可以自己调的对吧？"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C03-002","timestamp":"2026-10-29T18:16:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"可以的周女士，回去试试就行。"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C03-003","timestamp":"2026-10-29T18:20:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"好的。那这个皮子平时需要特别护理吗？"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C03-004","timestamp":"2026-10-29T18:25:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"尽量别淋雨，也别长时间暴晒。我把护理说明发您，里面写得比较详细。"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C03-005","timestamp":"2026-11-02T20:04:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"我刚试着调了一下肩带。"},
