        {"message_id":"MSG-C09-006","timestamp":"2024-05-08T11:45:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"没问题，包装我会提前交代好。礼卡留空给您，价格相关的内容也不会放进礼盒里。"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C09-007","timestamp":"2024-05-08T12:02:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"好的，谢谢。"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C09-008","timestamp":"2025-12-16T16:08:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"这条手链尺寸可以调吗？"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C09-009","timestamp":"2025-12-16T16:14:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"可以调整的。"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C09-010","timestamp":"2025-12-16T16:18:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"是送伴侣的，我不太确定手围。"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C09-011","timestamp":"2025-12-16T16:25:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"那最好先确认一下尺寸，不然可能戴着不太合适。"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C09-012","timestamp":"2025-12-16T16:29:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"嗯，但想给个惊喜，不太方便直接问。"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C09-013","timestamp":"2025-12-16T16:33:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"明白，那我先把尺寸范围发您参考。"}
      ]
