        {"message_id":"MSG-C12-001","timestamp":"2026-08-15T16:34:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"今天看的两款包，皮面处理是一样的吗？"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C12-002","timestamp":"2026-08-15T16:41:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"不完全一样。两款的皮面质感有区别，我整理一下材质说明给您。"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C12-003","timestamp":"2026-08-18T20:02:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"结构款的缝线能拍近一点吗？"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C12-004","timestamp":"2026-08-18T20:03:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"最好原图，不要滤镜。"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C12-005","timestamp":"2026-08-18T20:17:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"可以，我明天到店拍一下。"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C12-006","timestamp":"2026-08-18T20:21:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"主要想看边缘和针脚的处理。"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C12-007","timestamp":"2026-08-19T14:28:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"江先生，我拍了几张细节照片，您看看。皮革和缝线部分都拍得比较近。"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C12-008","timestamp":"2026-08-19T15:46:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"看到了。还有内部结构的图吗？"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C12-009","timestamp":"2026-08-19T16:03:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"内部结构您到店看会更直观，照片可能不太容易看清。"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C12-010","timestamp":"2026-09-02T19:10:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"江先生，之前看的那款您还在考虑吗？"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C12-011","timestamp":"2026-09-02T21:04:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"还在比较，不着急决定。"},
        {"message_id":"MSG-C12-012","timestamp":"2026-09-02T21:05:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"如果有具体工艺资料可以发我，其他暂时不用。"}
      ]
